cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite the paper below.
title: "Q-Planning: Beyond Imitation — Self-Improving Robot Policies via Off-Policy Q-Planning"
abstract: >-
  Companion code for the CoRL 2026 paper. Pairs a frozen behaviour-cloning policy with a
  small off-policy Q-function over action chunks, uses the Q-function to select among the
  policy's own proposals at inference, and improves by updating only the Q-function on
  deployment rollouts — including failures, which imitation cannot use.
